5. What a reviewer would most plausibly have missed across 8 rounds.

OUTPUT FORMAT
Per finding: SEVERITY (P0 blocks GA / P1 fix before GA / P2 follow-up),
FILE:LINE, concrete failure scenario, minimal fix. Cite the diff.
